ction><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>博思推免考核</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>博思推免考核</span></strong><span>正式开放申请！报名截止至</span><strong><span><span>7月16日23:59。</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>轮次</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>申请截止日期</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>数理评估</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>线下考核</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>博思</span></p><p><span>推免考核</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>7月16日23:59</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>7月24日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>8月</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名系统：</span></strong></p><p><span>https://app.fdsm.fudan.edu.cn/admission/application/mp</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>博思推免考核的数理评估范围：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>◆ 微积分(函数、极限、连续、一元函数微积分学、多元函数微积分学、无穷级数、常微分方程)；</span></p><p><span>◆ 线性代数(行列式、矩阵、向量、线性方程组、矩阵的特征值和特征向量、二次型、正定矩阵、正交矩阵)；</span></p><p><span>◆ 概率论与数理统计(随机事件和概率、随机变量及其概率分布、二维随机变量及其概率分布、随机变量的数字特征、大数定律和中心极限定理、数理统计的基本概念、参数估计、假设检验)。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>统计与数据科学系、金融与财务学系、管理科学系和信息管理与商业智能系四个系难度要求相当于全国硕士生入学考试的高等数学（一）；</span></p><p><span>企业管理系、会计学系、应用经济学系、市场营销学系四个系难度要求相当于全国硕士生入学考试的高等数学（三） 。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>领创体验活动QA</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>我该如何联系到复旦管院的招生老师？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>如在申请过程中遇到关于</span></span><strong><span><span>申请流程、材料提交或志愿修改</span></span></strong><span><span>等任何方面的疑问，都可以通过 </span></span><strong><span><span><span>upec@fudan.edu.cn</span></span></span></strong><span><span> 与我们联系。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请体验活动时需提供前五学期还是前六学期的成绩证明？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>现阶段申请时，申请人仅需提供前五学期的成绩证明即可，待第六学期成绩公布后，须及时通过</span></span><strong><span><span>系统/邮件</span></span></strong><span><span>等方式完成补充提交。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>若所在学院无法开具排名证明，或成绩单无法加盖教务部门公章，应如何处理？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>任何特殊情况，</span></span><strong><span><span>均可以通过邮件联系我院</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请提交后可以更改志愿吗？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>可以，通过邮件形式告知我院想要更改的志愿即可，后续是否需要再次接受评估视具体情况而定。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请提交后可以更新信息和材料吗？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>可以，我院欢迎同学们随时更新自己的材料，通过邮件形式更新即可</span></span><strong><span><span><span>（需附上报名号、姓名及相关证明材料），切忌</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>直接在系统中点击“终止申请”。</span></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>雅思没到7.5，可以申请GMiM/GMIF吗？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>完全可以，我院对于英语成绩没有硬性要求，申请时提供六级/托福/雅思/GRE/GMAT任何一个有效成绩即可，取最高成绩。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>我在领创体验活动中未能拿到直通资格，可否报名申请参加智科体验活动？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>可以，操作类似于更改申请志愿，须在智科体验活动报名截止前通过邮件形式告知我院。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>我在领创体验活动中未能拿到直通资格，后续还有希望吗？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>在第一批领创体验活动中未能拿到直通资格也可能在第二批体验活动结束后拿到直通资格</span></span><strong><span><span><span>（无需重复参加）</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>复旦管院哪个专硕项目更容易申请？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>我们建议根据</span></span><span><strong><span><span>兴趣、能力、学业职业规划</span></span></strong></span><span><span>等维度来选择适合自己的专业，而不是考虑申请难度而盲目选择，</span></span><strong><span><span><span>没有容易的只有最适合自己的项目</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>理工跨保经管对专业知识有什么要求？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>对理工背景学生的评估中不会对专业知识设定相关要求，</span></span><strong><span><span><span>但最好能表现出一定的商业意识</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>如果前序体验活动未入围，如何继续申请下一轮体验活动？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>未能入选第一轮领创体验活动/博思推免考核的申请者则将自动进入第二轮体验活动的选拔中，无需进行其他操作。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>领创体验活动线上与线下参加有什么区别？</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>线上或线下参加领创体验活动</span></span><strong><span><span><span>不会存在任何差异</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>考虑到互动体验，</span></span><span><span>我院欢迎各位申请人选择线下方式参加。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>博思推免考核QA</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请博思推免考核的时候，需要准备专业相关的论文吗？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院不严格要求必须有相关的论文或发表。如没有相关论文，可以通过个人陈述以及科研计划等材料展现自身研究兴趣以及科研潜力。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>管院的硕博连读项目对英文要求高吗？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院会高额资助所有博士进行6-12个月的海外联合培养，因此对于申请硕博连读项目同学的英语会有一定的要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>需不需要提前联系导师？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>并不需要。同学们可以在硕士学习阶段充分探究科研兴趣和了解博导研究方向，研二下再根据自己的情况，从我院60多位博导中，与合适的导师双向选择。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>Q</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>未参加学术评估是否就不能申请？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>并不是。未参加学术评估的同学亦可通过背景审核综合排名获得参加资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span><span>更多关于申请方面的疑惑</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎发送邮件咨询</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>也欢迎在文末留言！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span> 相关链接 </span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247522703&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fd42cc7725d776248075956a3cd38f47&amp;click_id=1062299032&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复旦管院GMiM&amp;GMiF的“双重赋能”答案：以全球金融语言与硬核技能，锁定顶尖投行与咨询</a></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247522541&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4ed29283e735baf43b8f7b14e4797787&amp;click_id=1689843659&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复旦管院DDIM的跨界竞争力：人均2.7个offer，近80%进顶尖金融/咨询/互联网</a></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247522243&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5c275183720f247edc986ae9a7795c9d&amp;click_id=1265796766&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=